cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ForceFlowAb in academic work, please cite this software."
title: "ForceFlowAb"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
abstract: >-
  ForceFlowAb is a physics-aware rectified-flow framework for antibody
  complementarity-determining region sequence and structure design that
  integrates mixture-of-experts modeling and energy-guided sampling.
authors:
